---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_period --> q_verify_sig: startTime <= now <= endTime
    q_check_period --> q_revert_timing: outside active period
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert SaleNotActive
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_amount: valid signature from authorized signer
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_amount --> q_store_bid: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: below minimum
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvest
    q_store_bid --> q_transfer: store encrypted bid data (ECIES encrypted with publicKey)
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update --> [*]: update position.investedCapital, totalCapitalInvested, emit Invested

    note right of q_store_bid
        INV-001: bids are encrypted with ECIES publicKey, unreadable until privateKey published
        INV-002: signature verification prevents unauthorized participation
        INV-003: amount >= minimumInvestAmount enforced
        INV-004: encrypted bid amount may differ from invested capital amount
    end note
